The '''Natural Texture Pack'''<ref>{{Cite|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131020034322/http://playxbla.com/more-screenshots-of-the-natural-texture-pack-coming-to-minecraft-xbox-360-edition|title=More Screenshots of the Natural Texture Pack Coming to Minecraft: Xbox 360 Edition!|website=playxbla.com|date=October 17, 2013|author=XBLA_Vulcan}}</ref><ref>{{cite|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/0/http://www.mojang.com/2016/08/its-only-natural-changelog-0157-for-pocket-win-10/|title=It's only natural: changelog 0.15.7 for Pocket & Win 10|website=[[Mojang.com]]|date=August 31, 2016|author=Marsh Davies}}</ref> is a [[texture pack (downloadable content)|texture pack]] that changes the game's textures to look more detailed and realistic. It is included in the {{editions|wiiu|switch}} by default.

